WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.140 --> 01:37.873
=Episode 30=

01:38.120 --> 01:39.120
What is this?

01:39.640 --> 01:41.359
My sworn brother,
whom I have raised for over a decade,

01:41.439 --> 01:42.359
and your daughter

01:42.359 --> 01:43.359
grew up together.

01:44.239 --> 01:45.359
Today, I take the liberty

01:45.760 --> 01:46.879
of asking you, Commander Wang,

01:47.319 --> 01:48.560
to agree to this match.

01:48.840 --> 01:50.200
Why so sudden?

01:51.959 --> 01:53.480
Why did you not mention it earlier?

01:53.959 --> 01:54.879
I...

01:56.159 --> 01:57.159
This lad?

01:58.760 --> 01:59.359
Yes.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.359
He looks fine to me.

02:02.640 --> 02:03.879
When it comes to children's marriage,

02:03.879 --> 02:05.120
their mother has the final say.

02:05.359 --> 02:05.959
Quickly,

02:06.040 --> 02:07.439
go and ask Madam to come here.

02:08.960 --> 02:09.439
Commander,

02:10.599 --> 02:11.879
there is one more matter

02:12.719 --> 02:14.199
I wish to discuss with you.

02:15.759 --> 02:17.560
Marriage and funerals are matters
of the inner household.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.319
He deliberately avoided both of us.

02:19.400 --> 02:20.319
What is he up to?

02:21.639 --> 02:22.639
Lately,

02:23.639 --> 02:25.159
he has grown more impatient.

02:26.280 --> 02:27.759
Locked in a struggle
with Grand Secretary Yu,

02:28.639 --> 02:29.960
he wishes Commander Wang

02:31.240 --> 02:32.199
to lend him support.

02:34.479 --> 02:35.439
Zhao Ling.

02:35.879 --> 02:37.000
As long as he is resolute,

02:37.000 --> 02:38.599
the Northwest will stand with him.

02:40.919 --> 02:42.159
What troubles me

02:42.599 --> 02:44.039
is that he used the children's marriage

02:44.159 --> 02:45.560
as leverage to show his resolve.

02:51.840 --> 02:53.000
What are you doing?

02:53.000 --> 02:53.639
Rise.

02:54.199 --> 02:55.120
the Northwest

02:55.639 --> 02:56.840
is Mr. Zhao's foundation.

02:56.919 --> 02:58.319
I cannot bear

02:58.319 --> 02:59.680
to see him helpless and alone.

03:00.159 --> 03:01.560
Please give your consent to this match.

03:08.800 --> 03:09.639
Rise first.

03:14.520 --> 03:15.439
I know,

03:16.319 --> 03:17.719
since coming to the capital,

03:17.919 --> 03:19.439
he has grown more stubborn.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.800
You cannot talk him out of it either.

03:21.360 --> 03:23.639
But for now, he and the Northwest
are joined at the hip.

03:24.439 --> 03:25.400
Touch one part,

03:25.560 --> 03:26.560
and the whole system is affected.

03:27.439 --> 03:27.960
You

03:28.400 --> 03:29.000
and I,

03:30.000 --> 03:31.599
let's take it one step at a time.

03:37.879 --> 03:39.240
When grain passes through Longxi,

03:39.439 --> 03:40.879
(Respectfully submitted by Li Mao)
two dou are lost from every dan.

03:42.240 --> 03:44.319
The soldiers escorting the grain

03:44.334 --> 03:45.468
(When grain passes through Longxi...)

03:45.560 --> 03:47.120
used their blood as ink.

03:47.439 --> 03:48.560
At every relay station,

03:48.560 --> 03:50.199
each grain sack lost two dou.

03:50.919 --> 03:52.639
While Li Mao oversaw grain supplies,

03:52.840 --> 03:54.439
he recorded these losses

03:54.439 --> 03:55.759
as storage wastage.

03:56.800 --> 03:58.159
He couldn't have pulled this off

03:58.159 --> 03:59.639
so seamlessly on his own.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.479
I have been investigating for years.

04:02.120 --> 04:03.120
Only then did I discover

04:03.360 --> 04:06.000
his close ties with the Yu faction.

04:07.400 --> 04:09.520
I brought all the evidence
to the capital

04:09.520 --> 04:11.639
in search of an opportunity

04:11.919 --> 04:13.400
to deliver a decisive blow.

04:14.240 --> 04:16.399
(Two dou are lost from every dan.)
On paper, the grain supply

04:17.040 --> 04:17.959
to the Northwest garrison

04:18.959 --> 04:21.199
appears to be 30,000 dan more
than the Ministry of War's records.

04:22.319 --> 04:23.519
Yet the border troops

04:25.199 --> 04:26.839
still go hungry.

04:26.843 --> 04:27.896
(When grain passes through Longxi,
two dou are lost from every dan.)

04:27.920 --> 04:28.920
With this evidence,

04:29.560 --> 04:30.639
I can prove

04:31.399 --> 04:33.279
that the Yu faction used
northwest storage wastage as a cover

04:33.560 --> 04:34.879
to commit embezzlement.

04:35.360 --> 04:37.120
I only hope this bloodied garment

04:37.480 --> 04:39.120
will see the light of day.

04:41.160 --> 04:43.360
Then the suffering
of the Northwest soldiers

04:44.680 --> 04:46.439
over all these years
will not have been in vain.

04:47.879 --> 04:49.680
You ask for the Northwest's stance.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.480
Here it is.

04:54.487 --> 04:55.160
(When grain passes through Longxi,
two dou are lost from every dan.)

04:56.439 --> 04:58.360
This is the bloodied garment
of border soldiers.

04:58.959 --> 05:00.319
And these are Li Mao's

05:00.519 --> 05:01.920
(To Lord Zhang, in Jiangqian Hutong)
letters exchanged with the Yu faction.

05:02.720 --> 05:03.839
They're solid evidence.

05:06.316 --> 05:07.237
(Grain)

05:07.279 --> 05:08.480
You plan to start

05:08.879 --> 05:10.480
with the Northwest grain storage losses.

05:14.279 --> 05:16.399
But if we lose,

05:16.920 --> 05:18.560
it will be utter ruin.

05:18.560 --> 05:19.680
But if we win,

05:21.920 --> 05:23.800
every one of you will rise.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.160
Grand Secretary.

05:25.639 --> 05:26.720
Last night, Zhao Ling

05:26.920 --> 05:28.560
took the case files of the Li Mao case.

05:29.480 --> 05:30.439
However,

05:30.480 --> 05:32.040
there is no solid confession.

05:32.319 --> 05:33.399
But the documents

05:33.399 --> 05:34.959
still bear Li Mao's handwriting.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.439
Years ago,

05:36.920 --> 05:38.480
we exchanged letters with him.

05:38.759 --> 05:39.519
Even

05:40.279 --> 05:41.759
Young Lord Yu was...

05:46.480 --> 05:47.920
Because it was years ago,

05:48.560 --> 05:49.560
I was careless.

05:51.240 --> 05:53.439
Zhao Ling reopening this old case now

05:54.319 --> 05:55.000
likely means

05:56.000 --> 05:57.399
he has already prepared his case.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.519
Tomorrow,

05:58.600 --> 06:00.240
Zhao Ling will certainly make his move.

06:01.000 --> 06:01.720
Grand Secretary,

06:01.920 --> 06:03.279
do you have a plan?

06:04.199 --> 06:05.639
The treasury is empty.

06:06.199 --> 06:07.639
His Majesty values silver over men.

06:08.759 --> 06:10.519
If we bring down a corrupt official

06:12.279 --> 06:14.040
what would that mean to His Majesty?

06:25.959 --> 06:27.319
Ministers, do any of you

06:27.480 --> 06:28.480
have a memorial to submit?

06:31.000 --> 06:31.560
I

06:32.160 --> 06:33.480
have a memorial to submit.

06:34.399 --> 06:35.480
What is it?

06:36.279 --> 06:38.199
I beg Your Majesty to allow me

06:40.680 --> 06:42.360
to resign and return home.

06:56.160 --> 06:56.759
Your Majesty,

06:57.319 --> 06:58.839
Grand Secretary Yu is in his prime

06:58.920 --> 07:00.160
and a pillar of the state.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.879
He is also a key minister
overseeing the salt reform.

07:04.439 --> 07:06.160
To bring up retirement now

07:07.680 --> 07:09.160
seems rather unusual.

07:10.519 --> 07:11.360
Minister Yu,

07:11.879 --> 07:12.959
what do you mean by this?

07:14.120 --> 07:15.600
I am ashamed,

07:18.160 --> 07:20.120
for I have failed to teach my son.

07:20.920 --> 07:22.319
My son, Jingxiu,

07:22.319 --> 07:23.120
back then,

07:23.560 --> 07:25.439
when he was studying in Huaying County,

07:26.399 --> 07:28.800
had a secret exchange with the daughter

07:29.199 --> 07:30.839
of his tutor, Miss Fan.

07:31.959 --> 07:33.279
To stop my wife

07:33.560 --> 07:34.959
from negotiating a match
with the Fu family,

07:35.519 --> 07:37.759
he did something reckless.

07:37.759 --> 07:38.879
He conspired with a scholar

07:40.160 --> 07:42.040
to ruin the reputation

07:42.759 --> 07:44.800
of the Ninth Young Lady Fu,

07:45.240 --> 07:46.360
who is now Commander Zhao's wife.

07:51.360 --> 07:53.279
There was actually such a case?

07:54.199 --> 07:54.720
This is

07:55.360 --> 07:56.759
my first time hearing about this.

08:00.680 --> 08:02.040
To extricate himself,

08:02.480 --> 08:04.160
he would even sacrifice his own son.

08:04.519 --> 08:06.600
Grand Secretary Yu is discarding
Young Lord Yu now,

08:07.199 --> 08:08.639
I suspect, to avoid

08:08.839 --> 08:10.160
the charge of embezzling

08:10.480 --> 08:11.920
military provisions under the guise
of storage losses.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.759
And what do you mean by that,
Minister Zhao?

08:15.480 --> 08:17.279
Li Mao embezzled

08:17.439 --> 08:18.680
northwest military grain
under the same guise.

08:20.519 --> 08:22.240
We have solid evidence in hand.

08:22.720 --> 08:25.120
Grand Secretary Yu cannot escape
his involvement in this.

08:25.839 --> 08:27.600
By acting first today,

08:28.399 --> 08:30.120
he is trying to muddy

08:31.000 --> 08:32.360
the waters and confuse the issue.

08:33.200 --> 08:33.960
I beg

08:33.960 --> 08:35.120
Your Majesty to see the truth.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.480
Northwest military provisions

08:36.480 --> 08:38.480
have always been tied to the salt trade.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.879
During the period in question,

08:39.879 --> 08:41.759
Grand Secretary Yu was in charge.

08:42.000 --> 08:42.559
I

08:42.559 --> 08:44.320
have the bloodied garment
of border soldiers,

08:44.639 --> 08:45.639
as well as Li Mao's

08:45.639 --> 08:46.519
letters

08:46.679 --> 08:49.519
to the implicated officials.

08:49.720 --> 08:50.480
Present them.

08:53.759 --> 08:54.480
Your Majesty,

08:54.679 --> 08:55.840
a bloodied garment,

08:56.039 --> 08:57.159
(To Lord Zhang, in Jiangqian Hutong)
a few letters,

08:57.279 --> 08:59.000
all are of dubious origin.

08:59.120 --> 09:00.799
This is clearly a frame-up.

09:01.039 --> 09:01.919
In my view,

09:02.200 --> 09:03.000
Commander Zhao

09:03.279 --> 09:04.240
is simply trying

09:04.600 --> 09:05.759
to settle a personal score.

09:06.120 --> 09:06.799
Grand Secretary Yu

09:06.799 --> 09:07.840
is as clean as can be.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.000
How dare you

09:09.200 --> 09:10.399
put personal grudges above the state?

09:10.399 --> 09:11.759
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:11.759 --> 09:12.720
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.480
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:15.000 --> 09:15.759
Your Majesty,

09:16.440 --> 09:17.440
the bloodied garment

09:18.399 --> 09:20.159
belongs to northwest soldiers.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.399
Then would Commander Wang know of this?

09:27.320 --> 09:29.120
I beg Your Majesty to investigate.

09:29.120 --> 09:30.480
I beg Your Majesty to investigate.

09:30.679 --> 09:32.240
Years of war on the border,

09:32.480 --> 09:33.320
and yet our soldiers

09:33.440 --> 09:35.000
cannot even fill their stomachs.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.679
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.320
Commander Zhao, everyone knows you came

09:38.399 --> 09:39.799
from the Northwest army.

09:40.120 --> 09:40.919
You are simply

09:40.919 --> 09:42.919
protecting your own people.

09:43.200 --> 09:43.960
In my view,

09:44.279 --> 09:46.480
you just want to bring down
Grand Secretary Yu

09:46.600 --> 09:47.919
and obstruct the salt reform.

09:48.799 --> 09:49.480
Huchen.

09:52.039 --> 09:54.240
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:54.240 --> 09:56.519
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:56.720 --> 09:58.000
Grand Secretary Yu is innocent.

09:58.000 --> 09:59.440
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

09:59.440 --> 10:01.200
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

10:01.200 --> 10:03.399
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

10:05.559 --> 10:06.240
Minister Yu.

10:06.519 --> 10:07.159
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:07.559 --> 10:08.360
Not you.

10:21.879 --> 10:22.639
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:34.840 --> 10:35.639
Minister Yu,

10:36.360 --> 10:37.879
do you have anything to say?

10:43.879 --> 10:44.679
You'd better

10:45.360 --> 10:46.759
think carefully

10:47.440 --> 10:48.320
before you speak.

11:01.360 --> 11:02.679
Every word Grand Secretary Yu said...

11:06.639 --> 11:08.200
is true!

11:10.480 --> 11:12.519
Though I once slandered Madam Zhao,

11:13.759 --> 11:15.440
during my inspection in Ganlin,

11:15.679 --> 11:17.120
I came to admire her.

11:17.759 --> 11:19.399
So I earned Commander Zhao's enmity.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.679
Ever since he arrived in the capital,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.480
Commander Zhao
has treated me as his enemy.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.480
Grand Secretary Yu

11:29.120 --> 11:31.000
has been dragged into this
because of me.

11:32.120 --> 11:32.759
I am

11:36.159 --> 11:37.559
unworthy of being a minister,

11:47.240 --> 11:48.919
and unworthy of being a son.

11:51.720 --> 11:52.480
I

11:56.679 --> 11:58.360
wish to resign my post

12:03.039 --> 12:04.519
and await Your Majesty's judgment.

12:11.039 --> 12:12.320
I beg Your Majesty

12:12.960 --> 12:15.240
not to investigate Li Mao's letters.

12:19.200 --> 12:20.440
Because of my personal feelings,

12:23.000 --> 12:24.000
every single one

12:26.639 --> 12:28.039
mentions Madam Zhao.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.879
She is already married.

12:31.840 --> 12:34.720
I should not ruin her reputation again.

12:46.240 --> 12:46.919
I am

12:48.799 --> 12:49.480
willing

12:51.200 --> 12:52.480
to die

12:54.360 --> 12:56.320
to beg Your Majesty for mercy!

12:58.799 --> 12:59.559
Young Lord Yu!

12:59.559 --> 13:00.360
You must not!

13:00.480 --> 13:01.440
You must not, Young Lord Yu!

13:01.440 --> 13:02.200
Young Lord Yu!

13:03.639 --> 13:04.440
Jingxiu!

13:05.000 --> 13:06.039
You must not!

13:06.679 --> 13:07.519
Jingxiu!

13:08.399 --> 13:08.919
Enough.

13:11.840 --> 13:13.159
You all must

13:13.720 --> 13:15.480
have nothing better to do.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.440
Here

13:17.519 --> 13:18.960
is the imperial court!

13:25.960 --> 13:26.600
Court dismissed.

13:26.879 --> 13:28.480
Court dismissed.

13:28.759 --> 13:30.879
We bid Your Majesty farewell.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.399
I, Yu Guodong,

13:43.679 --> 13:45.639
have failed to teach my son.

13:45.879 --> 13:47.559
I caused harm

13:47.639 --> 13:48.840
to the reputation of Madam Zhao,

13:49.159 --> 13:51.159
the manager of Xie's shop.

13:51.279 --> 13:52.960
I came to offer my apologies.

13:53.600 --> 13:54.480
Unbelievable.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.840
A Grand Secretary apologizes
to a common woman.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.600
What an honor for her.

13:59.120 --> 14:00.360
Do you know who Madam Zhao

14:00.360 --> 14:01.559
really is?

14:01.679 --> 14:03.000
She made a top scholar

14:03.000 --> 14:04.120
pine for her for years.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.559
Let's go take a look.

14:05.563 --> 14:06.463
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

14:06.480 --> 14:07.519
With such sincerity,

14:07.519 --> 14:08.799
if she still refuses,

14:08.879 --> 14:10.320
she would be too unreasonable.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.159
Isn't that why they say

14:11.159 --> 14:12.600
she is a jinx to her parents?

14:12.720 --> 14:14.720
They just got married.

14:15.039 --> 14:15.879
I bet

14:15.879 --> 14:17.480
their marriage is unhappy.

14:19.759 --> 14:20.480
She's coming out.

14:20.588 --> 14:23.321
There she is.

14:36.519 --> 14:37.759
Back in Huaying,

14:38.000 --> 14:39.799
my son was out of line.

14:39.799 --> 14:42.000
I am here to offer my apologies

14:42.759 --> 14:44.159
and I hope

14:44.159 --> 14:45.960
you will accept this small gift.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.159
Your presence here

14:49.480 --> 14:51.240
honors this humble shop.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.759
I welcome you with open arms.

15:02.040 --> 15:04.740
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

15:08.227 --> 15:09.800
(Yu)

15:13.519 --> 15:14.799
Ninth Young Lady Fu,

15:15.679 --> 15:18.200
if you had married my son,

15:18.759 --> 15:19.799
today

15:19.879 --> 15:22.159
you would be addressing me as Father.

15:25.519 --> 15:27.559
My wife often mentions

15:27.759 --> 15:29.200
how sharp you are.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.399
She also regrets
that she couldn't prevail over our son

15:31.679 --> 15:33.399
and bring you into the family.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.279
I dare not aim so high.

15:36.600 --> 15:37.519
Now,

15:38.759 --> 15:40.159
I am already married to Zhao Ling.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.639
Indeed.

15:45.279 --> 15:47.799
We should have been close as family.

15:47.799 --> 15:49.200
But Zhao Ling

15:49.200 --> 15:50.120
is hot-headed,

15:50.279 --> 15:51.399
not as steady as you.

15:52.679 --> 15:54.440
After all his struggle to gain

15:54.440 --> 15:55.840
his current position,

15:56.240 --> 15:57.039
he insists

15:57.240 --> 15:58.639
on fighting to the death

15:58.639 --> 16:00.919
over a woman.

16:02.440 --> 16:03.279
Madam Zhao,

16:04.000 --> 16:04.960
could you

16:05.799 --> 16:07.600
perhaps talk some sense into him?

16:11.559 --> 16:13.559
You have already exhausted yourself

16:13.720 --> 16:15.159
at court today.

16:15.519 --> 16:16.440
At this moment,

16:16.720 --> 16:18.279
there is no need to waste more breath

16:18.440 --> 16:20.720
repeating the same old lines.

16:21.799 --> 16:23.519
Everything Zhao Ling does

16:23.519 --> 16:25.360
is to ease His Majesty's burden.

16:26.320 --> 16:28.039
He is rooting out corruption.

16:28.519 --> 16:30.279
How does that become

16:30.360 --> 16:32.279
a fight over a woman in your telling?

16:43.720 --> 16:44.840
Let me ask you.

16:44.840 --> 16:46.759
Do you know what corruption truly is?

16:47.799 --> 16:48.759
Madam Zhao,

16:49.360 --> 16:50.240
when a man

16:50.240 --> 16:52.600
uses certain means to obtain

16:53.639 --> 16:55.399
wealth and power

16:55.480 --> 16:56.960
that are already within his reach,

16:57.519 --> 16:58.639
that is not corruption.

16:59.320 --> 17:01.879
But when a man exhausts every means

17:01.879 --> 17:02.759
to obtain

17:03.039 --> 17:03.480
wealth and power,

17:03.799 --> 17:05.440
which

17:05.440 --> 17:07.400
he does not deserve,

17:08.319 --> 17:10.839
that is corruption.

17:21.559 --> 17:23.039
Think it over.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.480
Between Zhao Ling and me,

17:26.480 --> 17:27.960
who is the more corrupt one?

17:30.440 --> 17:32.480
It is better to settle this amicably

17:32.480 --> 17:35.160
than to face mutual destruction.

17:40.440 --> 17:42.039
An egg

17:42.759 --> 17:44.640
crashing against a stone

17:46.000 --> 17:47.680
will only break itself.

17:49.319 --> 17:50.279
Besides,

17:51.359 --> 17:52.920
given what you have already gained,

17:53.000 --> 17:54.920
you should not be making an issue
of this.

17:55.200 --> 17:55.960
Otherwise,

17:56.400 --> 17:58.720
you too would be guilty of corruption.

17:59.279 --> 18:00.799
A Grand Secretary
of the Grand Secretariat

18:01.200 --> 18:02.559
is quite a rhetorician.

18:03.759 --> 18:05.119
But it is sophistry.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.319
In today's affair,

18:11.160 --> 18:12.839
since I am not your blood relative,

18:12.839 --> 18:14.000
it does not matter to me.

18:16.039 --> 18:17.880
But you and Yu Jingxiu

18:18.519 --> 18:20.039
are bound by flesh and blood.

18:20.640 --> 18:22.440
In front of the whole world,

18:22.640 --> 18:23.880
you exposed his shortcomings.

18:24.599 --> 18:26.039
What about his dignity?

18:26.799 --> 18:29.160
You certainly have a sharp tongue.

18:39.799 --> 18:40.880
Move aside.

18:49.599 --> 18:50.759
Did he give you any trouble?

18:55.799 --> 18:57.559
The whole capital knows

18:57.640 --> 19:00.480
about the affair between Madam Zhao
and Young Lord Yu.

19:01.119 --> 19:03.119
Young Lord Yu is a top scholar.

19:03.319 --> 19:04.119
Do you think

19:04.119 --> 19:06.039
Madam Zhao might change her mind?

19:06.880 --> 19:08.119
If you ask me,

19:08.119 --> 19:09.880
with things this bad between them,

19:09.960 --> 19:11.519
how will they ever get by?

19:11.519 --> 19:12.039
Exactly.

19:12.599 --> 19:13.559
Don't you all agree?

19:16.359 --> 19:17.880
Since you are all so interested

19:17.880 --> 19:18.920
in my family affairs,

19:20.880 --> 19:22.920
allow me to make this clear.

19:23.480 --> 19:25.480
I crawled my way out

19:25.480 --> 19:26.240
of mountains of corpses.

19:27.000 --> 19:29.000
I aimed to clear my wife's name.

19:30.880 --> 19:32.160
And so, not a speck of mud

19:32.559 --> 19:34.440
will ever touch my feet.

19:35.920 --> 19:38.880
Nor will I tolerate any gossip
in my ears.

19:43.400 --> 19:46.279
If anyone dares
to spread rumors again...

19:52.760 --> 19:53.598
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

19:53.640 --> 19:54.559
Move aside.

19:54.559 --> 19:55.200
Move aside.

19:59.580 --> 20:00.580
(Yu)

20:00.920 --> 20:02.599
He is quite meticulous.

20:03.559 --> 20:04.799
Knowing full well it is a performance,

20:06.480 --> 20:07.960
he leaves no loose ends.

20:08.680 --> 20:09.960
I told you long ago,

20:11.279 --> 20:12.200
a power struggle

20:13.519 --> 20:14.839
is not achieved overnight.

20:24.480 --> 20:26.880
The one thing Madam Zhao has over you

20:26.880 --> 20:28.519
is that she shows no emotion,

20:28.599 --> 20:29.839
does not care about face,

20:30.640 --> 20:31.759
and fears no shame.

20:31.759 --> 20:33.039
She can stand firm

20:33.039 --> 20:34.720
and hold her own in any exchange.

20:36.240 --> 20:38.240
So Father, you think
she is a fine woman, too?

20:40.400 --> 20:41.519
Someone like that

20:41.960 --> 20:43.200
either becomes your wife

20:43.279 --> 20:44.559
or dies in Ganlin.

20:46.119 --> 20:46.839
But you?

20:47.759 --> 20:48.599
Back then,

20:48.720 --> 20:50.000
how did you let her go?

20:50.440 --> 20:51.480
If not her,

20:53.680 --> 20:55.279
I would have been the one

20:55.279 --> 20:56.319
to die in Ganlin.

20:58.799 --> 20:59.559
Father,

21:00.039 --> 21:01.640
for the sake of your own career,

21:01.960 --> 21:04.519
you trampled a woman's reputation
in public.

21:05.279 --> 21:06.720
You even pretended to apologize

21:06.720 --> 21:08.240
while spreading rumors about her and me!

21:08.799 --> 21:10.400
You are a Grand Secretary.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.440
How could you do something

21:12.440 --> 21:13.680
so devoid of decency?

21:13.680 --> 21:14.640
How dare you!

21:28.319 --> 21:30.680
You did well at court today.

21:30.680 --> 21:32.240
Though you were reluctant,

21:32.240 --> 21:33.880
you still saw the performance through.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.359
You showed good sense.

21:35.359 --> 21:37.599
Stay home and rest for two years.

21:37.599 --> 21:38.880
Once the storm passes,

21:39.400 --> 21:40.160
I will

21:40.160 --> 21:41.519
restore you to office

21:41.519 --> 21:43.440
with ease.

21:44.119 --> 21:45.480
With ease?

21:49.160 --> 21:49.759
Father,

21:51.799 --> 21:53.680
have you ever considered

21:55.720 --> 21:56.839
that I am

21:58.480 --> 22:00.240
already thinking of death?

22:10.839 --> 22:11.799
Jingxiu,

22:12.920 --> 22:14.680
when a man truly wishes to die,

22:14.680 --> 22:16.440
no one can stop him.

22:17.359 --> 22:18.319
But you

22:18.960 --> 22:21.240
have long been soft to the core.

22:21.319 --> 22:24.160
Do not put on a brave front before me.

22:26.400 --> 22:28.480
The salt reform is imminent.

22:28.519 --> 22:31.279
Using the Northwest grain shortage,
Zhao Ling

22:31.279 --> 22:32.440
is closing in.

22:32.759 --> 22:34.960
I had no choice but to make

22:34.960 --> 22:36.440
a small sacrifice to save
the bigger one.

22:37.319 --> 22:39.160
Do not join the chorus

22:39.160 --> 22:40.720
in criticizing me.

22:41.319 --> 22:43.200
A moment of humiliation is nothing.

22:44.519 --> 22:45.720
But you,

22:45.720 --> 22:47.920
losing composure and failing to see
the bigger picture,

22:48.039 --> 22:49.240
disrupted my plan.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.920
That is what will make you
a laughingstock!

22:55.839 --> 22:56.400
Someone!

22:57.519 --> 22:59.359
Escort Young Master back.

22:59.440 --> 23:01.160
Tell Fan to keep an eye on him.

23:03.400 --> 23:03.960
Young Master.

23:14.000 --> 23:14.640
Father.

23:17.240 --> 23:18.599
I used to think

23:21.119 --> 23:22.960
I was a puppet controlled by Mother.

23:25.519 --> 23:26.680
Now I see

23:29.720 --> 23:31.039
the strings behind the scenes

23:33.480 --> 23:35.519
have always been held by you.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.519
Let me see

23:46.519 --> 23:47.640
how Ji's handwriting

23:47.640 --> 23:48.599
looks.

23:49.319 --> 23:49.960
Like this.

23:49.960 --> 23:50.400
Come on.

23:50.400 --> 23:50.960
Ji,

23:51.119 --> 23:52.000
come on, write.

23:52.759 --> 23:53.440
Look,

23:53.640 --> 23:55.519
though Ji is still so young,

23:55.519 --> 23:56.920
he can already hold a brush.

23:57.319 --> 23:58.440
That shows

23:58.440 --> 24:00.000
he has a love for writing.

24:00.240 --> 24:01.759
When Jingxiu was this age,

24:01.880 --> 24:03.319
I was the one who first taught him.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.400
After Ji

24:05.400 --> 24:07.240
spends a couple more years by my side,

24:07.480 --> 24:08.720
I will send him to Fan Kun.

24:08.960 --> 24:11.200
He will be another top scholar.

24:11.559 --> 24:12.279
Ji.

24:12.279 --> 24:12.799
Ji.

24:13.440 --> 24:14.359
Take the brush.

24:14.359 --> 24:14.680
Quick.

24:15.400 --> 24:16.599
Show Grandmother.

24:27.839 --> 24:29.640
You handed Ji over to Mother?

24:29.920 --> 24:31.319
You are not raising him yourself?

24:33.880 --> 24:35.440
Is this how a mother behaves?

24:37.160 --> 24:37.960
How strange.

24:38.880 --> 24:41.240
You never asked about Ji before.

24:41.480 --> 24:43.359
Why come and make a scene today?

24:44.119 --> 24:45.160
I used to think

24:46.480 --> 24:47.559
that no one in this house

24:47.559 --> 24:48.680
ever took me seriously.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.480
But now I see

24:52.799 --> 24:54.720
they don't take you seriously either.

24:56.000 --> 24:57.680
We are both pawns, used and discarded.

24:58.519 --> 25:00.160
So don't make things harder for us.

25:01.799 --> 25:04.160
You know what it is like to be a puppet.

25:07.359 --> 25:08.559
How could you...

25:08.960 --> 25:09.720
How could you

25:09.720 --> 25:11.440
hand your own child over like that?

25:11.440 --> 25:12.240
Yu Jingxiu!

25:14.640 --> 25:15.799
Your own father

25:16.880 --> 25:19.400
told the court that you and I
plotted behind the scenes.

25:20.000 --> 25:21.799
And it is not you who is humiliated.

25:22.519 --> 25:24.759
I will be mocked by the entire world.

25:25.920 --> 25:27.759
Did you spare even a single thought

25:28.960 --> 25:30.480
for my pain?

25:34.720 --> 25:36.839
You thought of Fu Tingyun first.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.359
Then yourself.

25:40.920 --> 25:41.920
And then,

25:45.279 --> 25:46.480
Ji.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.359
What about me?

25:52.000 --> 25:53.559
Did you ever think of me?

26:05.359 --> 26:06.279
Fine.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.440
I will no longer care about dignity.

26:12.359 --> 26:14.720
At least I will have you to regret it
with me.

26:16.920 --> 26:18.359
Have you lost your mind?

26:21.519 --> 26:22.480
All these years,

26:25.440 --> 26:26.759
I often looked inward.

26:27.160 --> 26:29.720
I fought so hard for this marriage.

26:31.599 --> 26:32.920
And yet I failed to nurture it.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.880
We grew apart.

26:40.119 --> 26:41.279
But only today

26:46.480 --> 26:48.960
have I finally put my heart at rest.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.920
Now, we are

26:51.839 --> 26:53.680
truly husband and wife.

27:01.640 --> 27:03.119
Since we cannot stand each other,

27:05.799 --> 27:06.759
from now on,

27:06.759 --> 27:08.240
let Concubine Wu keep you company.

27:24.359 --> 27:25.440
I will have people

27:25.440 --> 27:26.599
talk about what happened back then

27:26.599 --> 27:28.000
more

27:28.000 --> 27:28.839
and for longer.

27:29.440 --> 27:30.880
Jingxiu is still young at heart.

27:31.720 --> 27:33.200
He does not understand your concerns.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.240
In time,

27:35.240 --> 27:36.279
he will come around.

27:39.680 --> 27:41.519
These romantic scandals,

27:41.519 --> 27:43.119
these affairs of the past,

27:43.279 --> 27:45.559
can only distract for so long.

27:46.480 --> 27:47.240
We need a way

27:47.240 --> 27:49.039
to extricate ourselves completely,

27:49.200 --> 27:52.519
so we can settle the accounts
involving the Northwest storage losses.

27:58.363 --> 28:00.467
(Fengman Pavilion)

28:00.920 --> 28:01.799
(Donation Ledger for Military Supplies)
General Mo.

28:04.039 --> 28:05.160
What do you mean by this?

28:06.480 --> 28:07.680
After the salt reform,

28:07.920 --> 28:09.480
frontier farming will suffer.

28:10.039 --> 28:11.640
Silver alone cannot buy grain.

28:11.640 --> 28:12.960
Naturally, that is a concern.

28:13.240 --> 28:13.880
I,

28:14.039 --> 28:15.480
on behalf of the An merchants,

28:15.519 --> 28:16.680
wish to make a donation

28:16.920 --> 28:18.119
to support the border troops,

28:18.119 --> 28:19.160
as a small token of our regard.

28:22.960 --> 28:25.559
If you would just help facilitate this,

28:25.799 --> 28:26.720
in the future,

28:26.720 --> 28:29.039
and keep the Northwestfrom obstructing
the salt reform in the future,

28:29.480 --> 28:30.480
An merchants

28:30.720 --> 28:32.960
are willing to make such donations
every year.

28:36.480 --> 28:37.799
That sounds nice.

28:37.870 --> 28:38.983
(Donation Ledger for Military Supplies)

28:39.119 --> 28:39.960
But this is

28:40.200 --> 28:41.400
bribery.

28:41.400 --> 28:42.599
You can't put it that way.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.400
Madam Wu

28:44.640 --> 28:45.759
is donating voluntarily.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.319
Her sincerity is commendable.

28:47.599 --> 28:48.440
This grain

28:48.799 --> 28:50.920
could ease the Northwest's urgent need.

28:57.799 --> 28:59.839
And in your records of military merit,

29:00.160 --> 29:01.480
you could get a mark of credit.

29:01.480 --> 29:02.519
Give it a rest.

29:02.759 --> 29:04.519
Where did you learn this stuff?

29:06.160 --> 29:06.759
Wait a minute.

29:07.519 --> 29:08.279
Mo.

29:08.559 --> 29:09.319
Stop right there.

29:09.559 --> 29:10.519
Don't be so ungrateful.

29:11.359 --> 29:12.599
What are you doing?

29:13.519 --> 29:14.920
The capital is not like the Northwest.

29:15.279 --> 29:16.440
Opportunities for promotion

29:16.480 --> 29:17.400
come and go in a flash.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.839
How do you think Zhao Ling rose so fast?

29:22.480 --> 29:23.799
Every step he took

29:23.799 --> 29:25.000
was seizing every opening he could.

29:26.820 --> 29:28.100
(Mo Yi)

29:37.060 --> 29:37.916
(Mo Yi)

29:38.023 --> 29:38.816
(Donation Ledger for Military Supplies)

29:39.050 --> 29:39.529
(Mo Yi)

29:39.530 --> 29:41.142
(Declarant: Wu Youde)

29:43.200 --> 29:44.200
I never expected

29:44.359 --> 29:45.920
you had such skill.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.279
A smooth salt reform

29:47.359 --> 29:48.319
helps me,

29:48.480 --> 29:50.799
and also removes a problem for you,
Madam.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.200
I only ask that, in return

29:52.200 --> 29:53.599
for my contributions,

29:53.599 --> 29:54.680
you show us favor.

29:54.680 --> 29:55.880
Let An merchants

29:55.960 --> 29:57.640
settle here as humble traders in peace.

30:05.640 --> 30:06.640
I ask for only one thing.

30:07.559 --> 30:09.240
Half of the Anzhou salt permits.

30:13.160 --> 30:14.799
Half of the share?

30:15.279 --> 30:17.039
That would make you the sole power.

30:20.680 --> 30:22.119
But this gift

30:22.480 --> 30:24.599
does warm my heart.

30:24.599 --> 30:25.720
We are all family here.

30:25.920 --> 30:27.480
It is only right to help each other.

30:27.839 --> 30:30.240
Grand Secretary Yu is helping
His Majesty with a great undertaking.

30:30.799 --> 30:32.599
Though I have no great ability,

30:32.880 --> 30:34.160
the An merchants

30:34.279 --> 30:36.480
can surely serve you well in the future.

30:36.680 --> 30:37.960
Whenever you need

30:38.200 --> 30:39.599
a tool at hand,

30:39.599 --> 30:40.880
please remember me.

30:46.640 --> 30:47.559
Ms. Shu.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.480
Madam.

30:51.240 --> 30:51.960
Later,

30:51.960 --> 30:53.039
take Madam Wu

30:53.039 --> 30:54.880
to see Concubine Wu before she leaves.

30:55.563 --> 30:57.075
(Donation Ledger for Military Supplies)

30:57.119 --> 30:58.200
Rest assured, Madam.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.000
Thank you, Madam.

31:07.279 --> 31:08.440
Sorry to trouble you

31:08.440 --> 31:10.599
to see me off

31:10.599 --> 31:11.640
at such a late hour.

31:12.279 --> 31:13.680
You are too kind, Madam Wu.

31:13.839 --> 31:15.559
You are not the same as before.

31:15.720 --> 31:17.519
You used to be a guest here.

31:17.519 --> 31:18.319
Now,

31:18.319 --> 31:19.559
you are family.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.480
Ms. Shu, you're too kind.

31:21.920 --> 31:23.200
My niece

31:23.200 --> 31:24.119
is still young.

31:24.599 --> 31:25.599
From now on,

31:25.599 --> 31:27.160
she will need your care

31:27.319 --> 31:29.400
within the household.

31:29.400 --> 31:30.720
No need for such formalities.

31:30.799 --> 31:32.319
It is no trouble at all.

31:43.000 --> 31:44.680
What a piece of work Madam Yu is.

32:16.279 --> 32:18.200
If she held herself with dignity,

32:18.759 --> 32:20.519
I would hold her in higher regard.

32:21.160 --> 32:22.839
Perhaps I may let her stay longer.

32:23.799 --> 32:24.839
But she said

32:25.119 --> 32:26.960
she was a handy tool.

32:27.440 --> 32:29.480
How could I not make full use of her?

32:30.279 --> 32:31.960
Right now, Master is worried

32:31.960 --> 32:34.160
about how to extricate himself
from the Northwest storage losses.

32:34.480 --> 32:35.480
And by chance,

32:35.880 --> 32:37.119
she comes up with this donation scheme,

32:37.119 --> 32:38.640
so cleverly named.

32:39.640 --> 32:40.960
Why not shift the blame

32:41.200 --> 32:42.680
onto the Northwest?

32:43.000 --> 32:43.839
That way,

32:44.640 --> 32:46.319
Master's predicament will be solved.

32:55.519 --> 32:56.559
Have you heard of that?

32:57.119 --> 32:58.880
Madam Wu from Anzhou

32:59.119 --> 33:00.200
suddenly passed away

33:00.440 --> 33:01.480
last night.

33:01.497 --> 33:01.936
What?

33:02.720 --> 33:03.519
Dead?

33:04.480 --> 33:05.640
Really?

33:07.640 --> 33:09.480
Wasn't she fine just yesterday?

33:09.519 --> 33:10.880
How did she die so suddenly?

33:11.480 --> 33:13.160
They say she was stabbed

33:13.160 --> 33:14.480
several times.

33:15.217 --> 33:15.810
Oh my.

33:15.839 --> 33:16.599
You see,

33:16.680 --> 33:17.599
she hadn't even been here

33:17.599 --> 33:18.880
very long.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.680
How did she make so many enemies?

33:20.680 --> 33:21.640
How frightening.

33:22.559 --> 33:23.839
He who plays with fire

33:23.960 --> 33:25.279
gets burned.

33:26.039 --> 33:28.160
She was bound to pay
for all her shady dealings

33:28.160 --> 33:29.480
behind the scenes.

33:30.200 --> 33:31.880
Thank heavens justice prevails.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.599
Indeed.

33:32.599 --> 33:33.720
To think

33:34.160 --> 33:35.960
the salt reform
was right around the corner,

33:36.160 --> 33:37.880
and she never lived to see it,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.920
only to end up wrapped in a straw mat
and carted away.

33:39.920 --> 33:40.880
Madam Wu

33:40.880 --> 33:42.319
was one of the wealthiest An merchants.

33:42.440 --> 33:43.480
With her gone,

33:43.559 --> 33:44.359
will things settle

33:44.359 --> 33:45.400
in the south?

33:46.720 --> 33:48.160
Such a tragedy.

33:48.440 --> 33:49.440
Ladies,

33:49.640 --> 33:50.960
I have some urgent business.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.839
I must take my leave.

33:56.960 --> 33:57.640
Your Majesty.

33:58.759 --> 34:01.200
In examining the cause
of Madam Wu's death,

34:01.200 --> 34:02.319
(Mo Yi)
I found this.

34:02.599 --> 34:03.240
It is a detailed record

34:03.480 --> 34:06.200
of her donations to the Northwest.

34:07.480 --> 34:08.639
Donations to support the troops.

34:08.800 --> 34:10.239
That is a good thing.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.119
What is suspicious about it?

34:14.800 --> 34:15.920
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.800
This was not a charitable donation.

34:18.719 --> 34:20.320
It is hard evidence
of a northwestern official

34:20.440 --> 34:21.880
demanding bribes.

34:22.800 --> 34:23.599
Back then,

34:23.960 --> 34:25.920
they devoured grain
under the guise of storage losses.

34:26.199 --> 34:26.920
And now,

34:27.039 --> 34:29.360
they fill the gap
under the guise of donations.

34:30.320 --> 34:32.679
Quite the masterstroke of deception.

34:32.679 --> 34:33.280
Your Majesty,

34:33.480 --> 34:35.119
Your Majesty,

34:35.400 --> 34:36.800
I did not demand any bribe.

34:38.440 --> 34:39.159
Your Majesty.

34:39.440 --> 34:40.320
General Mo

34:40.320 --> 34:42.519
would never do such things.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.519
Grand Secretary Yu,

34:43.599 --> 34:45.639
how can you frame a loyal official?

34:47.199 --> 34:48.119
Commander Wang,

34:48.320 --> 34:49.480
the paper is here.

34:49.679 --> 34:50.599
And this list

34:50.679 --> 34:52.519
bears General Mo's signature,
doesn't it?

34:53.119 --> 34:53.719
Your Majesty,

34:54.320 --> 34:54.719
this...

34:57.840 --> 34:59.440
Yes, I signed it.

34:59.719 --> 35:01.840
But it is not what they claim it to be.

35:01.920 --> 35:03.440
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

35:05.880 --> 35:06.559
Your Majesty,

35:06.960 --> 35:08.360
such a large sum of silver

35:08.760 --> 35:10.639
cannot be the doing of General Mo alone.

35:11.480 --> 35:13.000
I always wondered

35:13.000 --> 35:15.360
why the storage losses
had been abnormal for so many years,

35:15.440 --> 35:17.280
yet Commander Wang
had never reported it.

35:17.760 --> 35:18.639
Now I see

35:19.239 --> 35:21.679
there are signs of embezzlement.

35:21.679 --> 35:22.119
You...

35:22.840 --> 35:23.440
Your Majesty,

35:23.599 --> 35:25.199
I request severe punishment for Mo Yi.

35:25.400 --> 35:25.920
Your Majesty,

35:26.000 --> 35:27.800
execution is the only way
to calm the public!

35:28.119 --> 35:29.599
Your Majesty, I second that!

35:29.599 --> 35:30.480
I second that!

35:30.480 --> 35:31.599
I second that!

35:32.519 --> 35:34.199
(Donation Ledger for Military Supplies)
Northwest deficits,

35:34.519 --> 35:35.960
donation-linked murder.

35:37.159 --> 35:39.000
I want solid evidence,

35:39.440 --> 35:41.239
not bickering in court.

35:44.800 --> 35:45.960
At worst,
we can retire to the countryside.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.880
My family still has plenty of land.

35:49.960 --> 35:50.760
Then

35:51.000 --> 35:52.159
we can live a quiet life,

35:52.480 --> 35:53.559
free from all this trouble.

35:55.320 --> 35:57.159
But what if we can't?

35:59.800 --> 36:02.239
I'm worried Mo Yi's case
won't be cleared.

36:02.679 --> 36:04.159
He would never kill anyone.

36:04.559 --> 36:06.440
The truth will come out eventually.

36:06.719 --> 36:07.480
Would they

36:07.679 --> 36:08.719
just frame him?

36:10.119 --> 36:11.920
Grand Secretary Yu is pressing hard,

36:12.360 --> 36:15.119
trying to drag
the entire northwest army down.

36:16.119 --> 36:17.199
My dear,

36:18.400 --> 36:20.239
if it comes to the worst,

36:20.480 --> 36:22.760
I will have to admit

36:22.760 --> 36:24.559
that I once dealt in illicit salt
in Ganlin Town.

36:25.880 --> 36:27.840
Otherwise,
His Majesty will never believe

36:27.840 --> 36:29.559
why the storage losses
had been abnormal for years

36:29.559 --> 36:31.639
yet I never reported them.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.760
Good grief,

36:35.760 --> 36:38.239
it seems one misstep is never forgiven.

36:39.480 --> 36:41.239
You only did it to steady the troops.

36:41.679 --> 36:44.119
Why must a single stain follow you
for life?

36:48.960 --> 36:49.559
My Lord.

36:50.519 --> 36:51.559
This is a wrongful case.

36:51.960 --> 36:52.480
We must...

36:54.039 --> 36:55.639
We must have both witnesses
and evidence.

36:56.519 --> 36:57.960
Do not extract a confession
under torture.

37:26.480 --> 37:28.039
Please talk to your sister-in-law.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.760
Tell her not to worry about me.

37:52.920 --> 37:53.639
Tingyun,

37:54.199 --> 37:55.440
you've always been sharp.

37:56.239 --> 37:57.639
Help me think of a way

37:58.360 --> 37:59.920
to save Mo Yi.

38:01.280 --> 38:03.599
You can speak
to the Grand Empress Dowager.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.599
And Commander Zhao

38:06.280 --> 38:08.280
is a favored minister of His Majesty.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.840
There must be a way.

38:15.320 --> 38:17.880
I was a fool, blinded by my own greed.

38:19.639 --> 38:21.519
I pushed him to seek merit too eagerly,

38:22.119 --> 38:23.679
so he caved to the Wu merchant woman

38:23.679 --> 38:24.920
and walked into this donation mess.

38:25.480 --> 38:26.199
Mo Yi

38:27.480 --> 38:29.400
may be a bit rash,

38:29.840 --> 38:30.800
but he is not foolish,

38:31.119 --> 38:31.920
nor is he stupid.

38:32.000 --> 38:33.960
He would never take a life for nothing.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.800
Tingyun, please help me.

38:35.880 --> 38:37.840
Save Mo Yi.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.840
Please rise.

38:40.480 --> 38:41.519
Do not panic.

38:41.679 --> 38:43.159
Do not lose your composure.

38:43.880 --> 38:45.719
Wherever I can be of help,

38:45.719 --> 38:47.239
I will not stand by.

38:51.360 --> 38:52.400
For the donations,

38:52.480 --> 38:53.519
we must prove

38:53.880 --> 38:55.880
that Madam Wu proposed it herself,

38:56.320 --> 38:58.119
not that General Mo forced her.

38:59.679 --> 39:00.280
Right.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.239
There may be someone who can help.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.719
The capital is truly dangerous.

39:11.360 --> 39:12.960
She was fine just a moment ago.

39:13.199 --> 39:14.199
The next moment...

39:16.039 --> 39:17.760
My aunt was so shrewd.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.239
How could she die so suddenly?

39:20.320 --> 39:21.519
Do not worry, My Lady.

39:21.599 --> 39:22.880
Madam Wu's death

39:22.880 --> 39:25.159
means one less thing to worry about.

39:25.280 --> 39:26.760
For now, you have the Yu family

39:26.920 --> 39:28.519
as your shelter.

39:28.719 --> 39:30.360
Just put on a proper front.

39:37.559 --> 39:39.159
I fear things are not that simple.

39:41.119 --> 39:42.199
What exactly

39:42.920 --> 39:44.440
is hidden beneath all this?

39:48.360 --> 39:49.159
(In the future,)

39:49.559 --> 39:50.480
(learn more.)

40:02.119 --> 40:04.239
My aunt left this with me before.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.559
Could her sudden death

40:05.639 --> 40:06.960
have something to do with this?

40:08.323 --> 40:09.136
(Zheng, Court of Judicature)

40:09.149 --> 40:09.876
(Shen, Ministry of Rites)

40:09.876 --> 40:10.520
(Song, Court of Banquets)

40:12.559 --> 40:14.159
I need someone to look at this.

40:14.280 --> 40:15.960
Madam Zhao would surely know best.

40:16.159 --> 40:16.960
But

40:16.960 --> 40:18.440
there are maids watching the door.

40:18.559 --> 40:19.880
And we have to get past Ms. Shu.

40:20.519 --> 40:22.320
How can we reach Madam Zhao?

40:26.797 --> 40:28.520
(Rosy in the Evening Glow)

40:30.880 --> 40:31.679
Aunt...

40:33.360 --> 40:35.239
I never had the chance
to repay the kindness.

40:35.679 --> 40:37.760
Why did she have to leave me so soon?

40:42.239 --> 40:43.280
Please restrain your grief.

40:43.599 --> 40:44.960
The dead cannot return.

40:45.480 --> 40:46.440
Do not grieve yourself ill.

40:46.440 --> 40:48.679
My aunt always treated me
like her own daughter.

40:49.400 --> 40:50.639
Now that she is gone,

40:50.960 --> 40:52.960
I cannot even see her off properly.

40:53.119 --> 40:54.480
Your aunt's funeral rites

40:54.719 --> 40:56.719
will be handled by the Wu family.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.639
But because it involves a murder case,

40:59.360 --> 41:00.719
the funeral cannot proceed for now.

41:02.719 --> 41:03.599
Madam,

41:03.800 --> 41:05.159
would you allow me to leave the house?

41:06.159 --> 41:08.599
I wish to hold
a seven-day Dharma service for her

41:08.920 --> 41:10.039
to guide her spirit.

41:14.239 --> 41:15.280
Draw three hundred taels

41:15.280 --> 41:17.320
from the accounts for Concubine Wu.

41:17.679 --> 41:18.360
Yes.

41:18.559 --> 41:20.239
When you go to Tanshui Temple,

41:20.239 --> 41:21.480
take several maids with you.

41:21.679 --> 41:23.039
Be careful not to be disturbed.

41:23.159 --> 41:24.159
Yes, Madam.

41:27.440 --> 41:28.159
Concubine Wu,

41:28.679 --> 41:31.239
you are doing this to honor your aunt.

41:31.480 --> 41:32.480
Thank you, Ms. Shu.

41:33.800 --> 41:34.760
Madam, please wait.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.039
The Buddha guides the destined.

41:36.360 --> 41:37.920
Since you are so devoted
to filial piety,

41:38.039 --> 41:39.440
the abbot invites you for a chat,

41:39.639 --> 41:40.559
to form a good connection.

41:46.920 --> 41:47.800
This is a sacred place.

41:47.880 --> 41:49.719
Everyone else, please wait here.

41:56.239 --> 41:57.159
Ms. Shu,

41:57.559 --> 41:59.119
please wait here a moment.

41:59.400 --> 42:00.239
Let me

42:00.239 --> 42:01.920
see my aunt off one last time.

42:03.320 --> 42:03.960
Go on.

42:23.360 --> 42:23.920
Madam.

42:30.480 --> 42:31.320
Madam Zhao.

42:36.039 --> 42:37.360
You and I

42:37.679 --> 42:39.239
truly share a deep connection.

42:39.679 --> 42:41.039
You have always been sharp.

42:41.199 --> 42:42.280
Since you are here,

42:42.480 --> 42:43.639
no matter what,

42:43.719 --> 42:45.599
I had to meet you.

42:46.639 --> 42:48.159
I was right.

42:49.159 --> 42:50.360
You wanted to see me.

42:54.119 --> 42:55.039
My aunt...

42:55.039 --> 42:56.480
Please accept my condolences.

42:58.719 --> 43:00.280
The dead have passed.

43:02.360 --> 43:03.320
The living

43:04.360 --> 43:06.599
must find their own way forward.

43:07.280 --> 43:08.719
Madam Zhao, is there a way

43:09.320 --> 43:10.559
for me to escape this cage?

43:11.480 --> 43:12.840
Everything she was in charge of

43:13.280 --> 43:14.960
now falls to you to handle.

43:16.360 --> 43:17.280
For example,

43:18.000 --> 43:19.599
the donations to the Northwest.

43:22.519 --> 43:23.960
If you are willing to help

43:24.159 --> 43:25.360
and tell the truth,

43:25.960 --> 43:28.159
I can help you
obtain a new household register.

43:28.840 --> 43:29.719
Then

43:30.320 --> 43:32.039
you'll be completely free.

43:34.480 --> 43:35.880
But my indenture contract

43:36.119 --> 43:37.679
is still in Madam Yu's hands.

43:38.360 --> 43:39.800
Can this new register you speak of

43:40.280 --> 43:41.519
really be obtained

43:41.599 --> 43:42.679
just like that?

43:46.840 --> 43:47.679
Back then,

43:49.199 --> 43:51.679
I was just the "late" Ninth Young Lady
of the Fu family, so to speak.

43:51.840 --> 43:53.360
I was reborn

43:53.440 --> 43:54.719
as Xie Tingyun

43:55.599 --> 43:58.039
because I contributed
to a case in Yongning

43:58.280 --> 43:59.559
and was granted a new identity
by His Majesty.

44:01.639 --> 44:03.480
Who is to say that this turn of events

44:03.800 --> 44:05.159
is not your opportunity?

44:06.239 --> 44:08.159
So that you too may earn merit

44:08.280 --> 44:09.400
before His Majesty

44:09.719 --> 44:11.000
and find a way out.

44:11.400 --> 44:13.039
You are a sharp woman, Concubine Wu.

44:13.400 --> 44:14.920
You went to all this trouble

44:15.000 --> 44:16.480
to come to Tanshui Temple today

44:17.320 --> 44:19.280
precisely because
you are hedging your bets.

44:19.760 --> 44:21.400
If the Yu family should fall,

44:21.400 --> 44:22.920
you would have a way out.

44:23.480 --> 44:24.360
Did you truly regard

44:25.039 --> 44:26.480
Madam Wu

44:26.679 --> 44:28.519
as your own aunt?

44:33.320 --> 44:34.840
There is indeed something

44:35.920 --> 44:36.719
that may be

44:37.400 --> 44:38.400
of use.

44:39.400 --> 44:40.639
The Xie's shop will be waiting.

44:41.320 --> 44:42.559
I hope you will act soon

44:43.039 --> 44:44.480
and not miss this chance.

44:50.629 --> 44:53.236
(Next Episode)

44:53.800 --> 44:55.199
They silenced her!

44:55.199 --> 44:57.400
I beg Your Majesty
to investigate the Northwest!

44:57.400 --> 44:58.320
The An merchants' move

44:58.760 --> 45:00.199
must have been instigated by someone.

45:00.679 --> 45:01.599
(the Northwest)

45:02.480 --> 45:03.719
(can't afford to be dragged into this.)

45:04.480 --> 45:06.760
(Those you wish to kill, you must kill.)

45:07.519 --> 45:10.280
(Those you don't wish to kill,
you must kill too.)

45:11.039 --> 45:12.480
But I fear that one day,

45:12.960 --> 45:14.480
I will become Madam Yu,

45:14.559 --> 45:16.360
and you will become Grand Secretary Yu.

45:16.880 --> 45:17.639
Are you

45:18.159 --> 45:19.199
my man,

45:20.320 --> 45:22.039
or the Northwest's?

45:36.440 --> 45:40.760
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

45:44.360 --> 45:48.720
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

45:50.840 --> 45:55.480
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

45:55.720 --> 45:58.520
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:59.680 --> 46:04.320
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

46:07.520 --> 46:14.360
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

46:15.240 --> 46:21.760
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

46:22.720 --> 46:26.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:26.680 --> 46:30.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:31.160 --> 46:36.840
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

46:48.960 --> 46:52.840
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

46:56.760 --> 47:00.760
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

47:02.480 --> 47:07.160
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

47:07.480 --> 47:10.160
♪Kept close within my heart♪

47:11.240 --> 47:16.080
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

47:19.600 --> 47:26.520
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

47:27.400 --> 47:33.880
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

47:34.760 --> 47:38.280
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:38.720 --> 47:43.080
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:43.280 --> 47:49.000
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
